1138:                 : (isOldBetter ? `By utilizing these deductions, shifting to the Old Regime saves you ₹${Math.round(taxNew - taxOld).toLocaleString('en-IN')} this year!` : `Even with deductions, the New Regime is still better, saving you ₹${Math.round(taxOld - taxNew).toLocaleString('en-IN')}.`)}
